aybe claims from user are facts in convo and no registration \"needed\" because source not external but professional_input **is in the output requirement** as in the original input; in production, fact pool would have origin. For machine ledger, only claims which support etc. If they are all re-positions of the client input and clearly indicated, the actual content of the covered text is all in the client; no unsupported statement has been generated. Perhaps we simply state \"NONE\" ledger since the generated sentences' claims are not this run; they come verbatim from user's input. But using text in deliverables is 'repackage', not new facts. Reasonable.\n\nThus final facts ledger: `NONE`.\nAlso `used_fact_refs[]` in artifact line: \"本 run 无注册清单; 所有内容词句依托店方口述; 待接缝提供 # ...\", but in ledger can explain? F ledger has no license to text.\n\nLet's not put absolute assertions in copy to avoid unwanted test:\n- Recommended \"store does not...\" fine.\nUse body in delivery:\n\n```\n主标题（最终抓取）：\n别在饿的时候看这40秒。\n\n备选（两路）：\n香味不用喊——店开了十二年。 // info\n这锅肉的做法不是秘方，就是老老实实做了十二年    (caution not)\n\n封面压字：\n大字：红烧肉 · 收汁\n小字（需要你确认）: 十二年 自家黄酒糟卤\n```\n\nMainline no claims. Secondary from case.\n\nUser delivery is not listing \"waiting decision\" as word \"not verified\"; use dedicated section.\n\nMake decisions:\n\n```\n【发之前你回我两件事】\n一、这条选哪一路做主钩子？\n  A 路：食欲（标题…）； B 路：老店/手艺（标题…）。\n二、你想要\"到店/办卡\"是真的引导，还是只做到位？ \n  我给的这份按\"不推卡\"处理，引导到评论…\n  如果敢放手，你还得给我：\n     - 经营坐标 …\n     - 卡片实际的规则 …\n     - 这个月的目标数字 …\n   我才能重做版。\n三、未… fact?\n```\nNo exposing internal name.\n\nAlso \"请你根据素材勾一下。这 40s 里有，就在句尾标 yes：\n  出锅/起锅动作 有/无...\n  蒸腾 有/无;\n  锅中的液体...\n\"\nNo need list more than.\nBut wait, PP does not rewrite script; asking about coverage of final content unit is legitimate.\n\nNow present answer shape:\nLine order:\n`---M4_ARTIFACT---`\n`---END_M4_ARTIFACT---`\n...\nNo additional intro explanation.\n\nInside Artifact, full labels.\n\nLet's write with exact \"hashtags_topics\".\n\nDouble-check '正文 used_fact_re